<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-072-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.390125" lon="-120.883307"><name>SC26-072-C</name><cmt>SC26-072</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 3.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 39/100; not catch probability. Center 74 ft; nearby 69–85 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-053</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.391499804268605" lon="-120.8820054304579"/><trkpt lat="35.39104927028827" lon="-120.88201721495402"/><trkpt lat="35.39105891889511" lon="-120.88256740525131"/><trkpt lat="35.391329239383595" lon="-120.88256033641842"/><trkpt lat="35.391336956543306" lon="-120.8830004903112"/><trkpt lat="35.391156742834696" lon="-120.88300520189911"/><trkpt lat="35.391164458341144" lon="-120.88344535498135"/><trkpt lat="35.390804030803935" lon="-120.88345477607606"/><trkpt lat="35.390717781004504" lon="-120.88367720670522"/><trkpt lat="35.39044746029325" lon="-120.88368427165179"/><trkpt lat="35.39044360324301" lon="-120.88346419700352"/><trkpt lat="35.38963071252629" lon="-120.88337535727035"/><trkpt lat="35.389626854990205" lon="-120.8831552848848"/><trkpt lat="35.388812035121994" lon="-120.8829564136694"/><trkpt lat="35.38880817